  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vitamin C</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Pores</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Uneven Texture</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A weightless, clean setting powder packed with protective, skin-refining actives for an instant diffused look and healthier-looking skin over time.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Light<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Pressed Powder <br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Probiotic: Enhances skin’s natural defense mechanisms.<br>- Quinoa Seed Extract: Minimizes the look of pores, retexturizes skin. <br>- Vitamin C: Neutralizes free radicals, visibly evens tone, supports natural collagen. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> A micro-milled antioxidant veil that sets without diminishing radiance. Ultra-sheer, this powder instantly smooths pores, evens skin tone, and sweeps away shine</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Gucci Westman&rsquo;s tip: A light-handed approach is best for applying powder. <br>-Use this as your last step to set your foundation and boost wear, and throughout the day to refresh makeup. <br>-Using Westman Atelier Powder Brush (sold separately), apply over makeup to set, or on bare skin for sheer diffused coverage. <br>-Use the translucent powder as an invisible skin-refining veil, and the tinted powders as a sheer veil to even tone.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Quinoa Seed Extract: Minimizes the look of pores and retexturizes the look of skin.<br>-Vitamin C: Neutralizes free radicals, visibly evens tone, and supports natural collagen.<br>-Probiotic: Enhances skin&rsquo;s natural defense mechanisms.<br><br>Zinc Laurate, Mica, Lauroyl Lysine, Silica, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Phytosteryl Macadamiate, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Enterococcus Faecalis, Butylene Glycol, Water, Hydroxyapatite, Zinc Oxide, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Extract, Chenopodium Quinoa Seed Extract, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Tocopherol, May-Contain: Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Red 30 (Ci 73360).<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
